BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d252dbb6ad83@community-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261114T080828Z
DTSTART:20261120T193000
DTEND:20261120T203000
SUMMARY:Ferndale Rep presents "Disney's Frozen: The Broadway Musical"
LOCATION:Ferndale Repertory Theatre\, 447 Main St
DESCRIPTION:The stage musical of the Disney film follows sisters Anna and 
 Elsa\; fun for all ages. Fridays at 7:30pm\; Saturdays and Sundays at 2pm
  (no regular show Sat 11/28). Running time about 2 hours plus intermissio
 n. $25 general\, $22 seniors 60+ and students. Family Day Sat 11/21: 4 ti
 ckets for $75 with code FROZEN26. Free sensory-friendly performance Sat 1
 1/28. Tickets & info\nhttps://www.visiteureka.com/event/ferndale-rep-pres
 ents-disneys-frozen-the-broadway-musical/
URL:https://www.visiteureka.com/event/ferndale-rep-presents-disneys-frozen
 -the-broadway-musical/
END:VEVENT
